(12, 'hero_design', 'Hero Section', '{{>cdnurl}}hero_design/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<div class=\'container-fluid\' style=\'min-height: 150px; background-image: url({{>cdnurl}}\\/hero_design\\/squareclip.png);background-repeat: no-repeat;background-position: center;background-size: cover;\'><div class=\'container\' style=\'min-height:150px;\'><h1>Edwiser Blocks<\\/h1><p>Quisque id mi. Nullam accumsan lorem in dui. Duis lobortis massa imperdiet quam. Praesent ac sem eget est egestas volutpat. Ut tincidunt tincidunt erat.<\\/p><div><a type=\'button\' class=\'btn btn-light mb-2\'><font face=\'Lucida Sans Unicode, Lucida Grande, sans-serif\' size=\'3\'><b><font size=\'2\'>BUY NOW<\\/font><\\/b><\\/font><\\/a><a type=\'button\' class=\'btn btn-dark mb-2\'><font face=\'Lucida Sans Unicode, Lucida Grande, sans-serif\' size=\'3\'><b><font size=\'2\'>BUY NOW<\\/font><\\/b><\\/font><\\/a><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"css\":\".block-content > .container-fluid > .container {padding-top: 150px;padding-right: 30px;padding-left: 30px;padding-bottom: 150px;max-width: 75%;}.block-content > .container-fluid > .container > h1 {color: #fff;text-decoration-line: none;font-family: \\\"Lucida Sans Unicode\\\", \\\"Lucida Grande\\\", sans-serif;font-size: 42px;}.block-content > .container-fluid > .container > p {color: #fff;font-family: \\\"Lucida Sans Unicode\\\", \\\"Lucida Grande\\\", sans-serif;font-size: 19px;}.block-content > .container-fluid > .container .btn-light {color: #313848;}.block-content > .container-fluid > .container > div {height: auto;width: auto;min-width: auto;min-height: auto;margin-top: 10px;padding-top: 30px;}.block-content > .container-fluid > .container > div > .btn {margin-right: 10px;border-top-style: inherit;border-right-style: inherit;border-bottom-style: inherit;border-left-style: inherit;border-top-width: 0;border-right-width: 0;border-bottom-width: 0;border-left-width: 0;} @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {.block-content > .container-fluid > .contai