\' src=\'{{>cdnurl}}grid_view\\/2.jpeg\' alt=\'\'><h5 class=\'overlay-title\'>Lorem Ipsum<\\/h5><\\/a><\\/div><div class=\'col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6\'><a href=\'#\' class=\'d-block mb-4 h-100\'><img class=\'img-fluid img-thumbnail\' src=\'{{>cdnurl}}grid_view\\/5.jpeg\' alt=\'\'><h5 class=\'overlay-title\'>Lorem Ipsum<\\/h5><\\/a><\\/div><div class=\'col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6\'><a href=\'#\' class=\'d-block mb-4 h-100\'><img class=\'img-fluid img-thumbnail\' src=\'{{>cdnurl}}grid_view\\/3.jpeg\' alt=\'\'><h5 class=\'overlay-title\'>Lorem Ipsum<\\/h5><\\/a><\\/div><div class=\'col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6\'><a href=\'#\' class=\'d-block mb-4 h-100\'><img class=\'img-fluid img-thumbnail\' src=\'{{>cdnurl}}grid_view\\/6.jpeg\' alt=\'\'><h5 class=\'overlay-title\'>Lorem Ipsum<\\/h5><\\/a><\\/div><div class=\'col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6\'><a href=\'#\' class=\'d-block mb-4 h-100\'><img class=\'img-fluid img-thumbnail\' src=\'{{>cdnurl}}grid_view\\/4.jpeg\' alt=\'\'><h5 class=\'overlay-title\'>Lorem Ipsum<\\/h5><\\/a><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\",\"css\":\".container.user-online-thumb {height: 100%;align-content: center;}.user-online-thumb .image_outer_container {margin-top: auto;margin-bottom: auto;border-radius: 50%;position: relative;}.user-online-thumb .image_inner_container {border-radius: 50%;padding: 5px;background: #833ab4;background: -webkit-linear-gradient(to bottom, #fcb045, #fd1d1d, #833ab4);background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #fcb045, #fd1d1d, #833ab4);}.user-online-thumb .image_inner_container img {height: 200px;width: 200px;border-radius: 50%;border: 5px solid #fff;}.user-online-thumb .image_outer_container .green_icon {background-color: #4cd137;position: absolute;right: 30px;bottom: 10px;height: 30px;width: 30px;border: 5px solid #fff;border-radius: 50%;}.overlay-title {position: absolute;bottom: 10px;padding: 10px;color: #ffffff;font-size: 18px;text-transform: uppercase;font-weight: 500;}@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {.overlay-title {font-size: 12px;}}\",\"js\":\"\"}', 2021071404, 0, 1, 'block', 'Gallery'),
(14, 'pricing', 'Pricing', '{{>cdnurl}}pricing/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<div id=\'main-container\' class=\'text-center py-5\'><div class=\'container\'><div class=\'w-100\'><h1 class=\'text-white\'>Pricing<\\/h1><\\/div><div class=\'row mx-0 mt-5 align-items-center\'><div class=\'col-12 col-sm-10 col-md-8 m-auto col-lg-4 text-center mb-4 item\' onmouseenter=\'removeHover()\'><div class=\'mb-4 p-4 bg-white rounded\'><h2 class=\'font-weight-600\'>Hobby<\\/h2><p class=\'lead font-weight-500  card-desc-color\'>Far far away, behind the word mountains, far from the countries Vokalia.<\\/p><p class=\'h1 mt-5 mb-5 font-weight-600\'>$99<\\/p><p><a class=\'btn btn-dark\' href=\'#\'>Buy Now<\\/a><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\'col-12 col-sm-10 col-md-8 m-auto col-lg-4 text-center mb-4 item hover\' onmouseenter=\'removeHover()\'><div class=\'mb-4 p-4 bg-white rounded\'><h2 class=\'font-weight-600\'>Advanced<\\/h2><p class=\'lead font-weight-500  card-desc-color\'>Separated they live in Bookmarksgrove right at the coast, a large language ocean.<\\/p><p class=\'h1 mt-5 mb-5 font-weight-600\'>$299<\\/p><p><a class=\'btn btn-danger\' href=\'#\'>Buy Now<\\/a><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\'col-12 col-sm-10 col-md-8 m-auto col-lg-4 text-center mb-4 item\' onmouseenter=\'removeHover()\'><div class=\'mb-4 p-4 bg-white rounded\'><h2 class=\'font-weight-600\'>Business<\\/h2><p class=\'lead font-weight-500  card-desc-color\'>Even the all-powerful pointing no control about the blind texts it is an almost life.<\\/p><p class=\'h1 mt-5 mb-5 font-weight-600\'>$799<\\/p><p><a class=\'btn btn-dark\' href=\'#\'>Buy Now<\\/a><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"css\":\"#main-container {background-image: url({{>cdnurl}}pricing\\/bg.jpg);background-size: cover;background-position: center;}.item:hover, .hover{transform: scale(1.05);transition: 0.1s ease-in-out;}.item .card-desc-color {color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);}\",\"js\":\"function removeHover() { var element = document.querySelector(\'.item.hover\');element.classList.remove(\'hover\');}\"}', 2021071506, 0, 1, 'block', 'Pricing'),
(15, 'courses', 'Courses', '{{>cdnurl}}courses/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<div class=\'container-fluid py-5\'><div class=\'text-center w-full\'><h2>Courses<\\/h2><p class=\'sub-text w-75 m-auto font-size-18 py-2\'>Phasellus tempus. Sed mollis, eros et ultrices tempus, mauris ipsum aliquam libero, non adipiscing dolor urna a orci. Cras varius. Praesent ac massa at ligula laoreet iaculis. Nullam vel sem.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\'edwiser-courses\' data-edwiser-dynamic data-shortcode=\'edwiser-courses\' data-vvveb-disabled-area data-catid=\'all\' data-layout=\'cldefault\'>[edwiser-courses catid=\'all\' layout=\'cldefault\']<\\/div><\\/div>\",\"css\":\".sub-text{font-family: \'Lucida Sans Unicode\', \'Lucida Grande\', sans-serif;}\",\"js\":\"\"}', 2021091928, 0, 1, 'dynamic', 'Courses & categories'),
(16, 'categories', 'Categories', '{{>cdnurl}}categories/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<div class=\'container-fluid py-5\'><div class=\'text-center w-full\'><h2>Course Categories<\\/h2><p class=\'sub-text w-75 m-auto font-size-18 py-2\'>Phasellus tempus. Sed mollis, eros et ultrices tempus, mauris ipsum aliquam libero, non adipiscing dolor urna a orci. Cras varius. Praesent ac massa at ligula laoreet iaculis. Nullam vel sem.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\'edwiser-categories\' data-edwiser-dynamic data-shortcode=\'edwiser-categories\' data-vvveb-disabled-area data-layout=\'clcategory\' data-btnlabel=\'Explore\' data-count=\'on\'>[edwiser-categories layout=\'clcategory\' btnlabel=\'Explore\' count=\'on\']<\\/div><\\/div>\",\"css\":\".sub-text{font-family: \'Lucida Sans Unicode\', \'Lucida Grande\', sans-serif;}\",\"js\":\"\"}', 2021092017, 0, 1, 'dynamic', 'Courses & categories'),
(17, 'coursesncategories', 'Courses & Categories', '{{>cdnurl}}coursesncategories/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\" cnc-title-wrapper\\\"><h3 class=\\\"m-0 text-center\\\">All Courses<\\/h3> <p class=\\\"desc p-0 text-center\\\"style=\\\"margin-bottom:40px\\\">Fundamentals of eLearning for Successful Online Learning Experiences<\\/p><div class=\\\"edwiser-cnc\\\" data-edwiser-dynamic data-shortcode=\\\"edwiser-cnc\\\" data-vvveb-disabled-area data-layout=\\\"coursesncategories\\\" data-show=\\\"courses\\\" data-catid=\\\"all\\\" data-date=\\\"all\\\" data-btnlabel=\\\"Explore\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\"><div class=\\\"section-all-courses-category-design-wrapper\\\" >[edwiser-cnc layout=\\\"coursesncategories\\\" show=\\\"courses\\\" catid=\\\"all\\\" date=\\\"all\\\"]<\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"css\":\".cnc-title-wrapper {padding: 50px 0px 0px 0px;background: url(\\\"{{>cdnurl}}coursesncategories\\/bg-image.png\\\");background-repeat: no-repeat;background-size: cover;background-position:center;}\",\"js\":\"\"}', 2021071626, 0, 1, 'dynamic', 'Courses & categories'),
(18, 'featuredcourses', 'Featured Courses ', '{{>cdnurl}}featuredcourses/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"fc-title-wrapper\\\"><h3 class=\\\"m-0\\\">Featured courses<\\/h3><hr class=\\\"header-content-divider\\\"><div class=\\\"edwiser-fc\\\" data-edwiser-dynamic data-shortcode=\\\"edwiser-fc\\\" data-vvveb-disabled-area data-layout=\\\"coursesncategories\\\" data-block=fetured-courses data-show=\\\"courses\\\" data-courseid=\\\"0\\\" data-date=\\\"all\\\" data-btnlabel=\\\"Explore\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\">[edwiser-fc layout=\\\"coursesncategories\\\" show=\\\"courses\\\" courseid=\\\"0\\\" date=\\\"all\\\"]<\\/div><\\/div>\",\"css\":\".fc-title-wrapper{max-width: 1320px;margin: 0 auto; padding:40px 24px 0px 24px;}.header-content-divider{margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border-top:1px solid #D5DDEA;}\",\"js\":\"\"}', 2021071638, 0, 1, 'dynamic', 'Courses & categories'),
(19, 'slider', 'Slider', '{{>cdnurl}}slider/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<div id=\\\"epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" class=\\\"carousel slide\\\" data-ride=\\\"carousel\\\" data-bs-ride=\\\"carousel\\\"><ol class=\\\"carousel-indicators ind-circle\\\" data-vvveb-disabled-area><li data-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-slide-to=\\\"0\\\" data-bs-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-bs-slide-to=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"active\\\"><\\/li><li data-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-slide-to=\\\"1\\\" data-bs-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-bs-slide-to=\\\"1\\\"><\\/li><li data-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-slide-to=\\\"2\\\" data-bs-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-bs-slide-to=\\\"2\\\"><\\/li><\\/ol><div class=\\\"carousel-inner\\\" role=\\\"listbox\\\"><div class=\\\"carousel-item active\\\"><div class=\\\"view imgBox\\\"><img class=\\\"d-block w-100\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/qa-remui.edwiser.org\\/staticcdn\\/CDN\\/slider\\/img1.jpg\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" alt=\\\"First slide\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"carousel-caption\\\"><h2>Light mask<\\/h2><p class=\\\"font-size-80 font-weight-800\\\">FIRST TEXT<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"carousel-item\\\"><div class=\\\"view imgBox\\\"><img class=\\\"d-block w-100\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/qa-remui.edwiser.org\\/staticcdn\\/CDN\\/slider\\/img2.jpg\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" alt=\\\"Second slide\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"carousel-caption\\\"><h2>Strong mask<\\/h2><p class=\\\"font-size-80 font-weight-800\\\">SECOND TEXT<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"carousel-item\\\"><div class=\\\"view imgBox\\\"><img class=\\\"d-block w-100\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/qa-remui.edwiser.org\\/staticcdn\\/CDN\\/slider\\/img3.jpg\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" alt=\\\"Third slide\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"carousel-caption\\\"><h2>Slight mask<\\/h2><p class=\\\"font-size-80 font-weight-800\\\">THIRD TEXT<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><a class=\\\"carousel-control carousel-control-prev\\\" href=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" data-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-bs-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-slide=\\\"prev\\\" data-bs-slide=\\\"prev\\\"><span class=\\\"carousel-control-prev-icon fa fa-angle-left\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><\\/span><span class=\\\"sr-only\\\">Previous<\\/span><\\/a><a class=\\\"carousel-control carousel-control-next\\\" href=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" data-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-bs-target=\\\"#epb-carousel-[[inst]]\\\" data-slide=\\\"next\\\" data-bs-slide=\\\"next\\\"><span class=\\\"carousel-control-next-icon fa fa-angle-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><\\/span><span class=\\\"sr-only\\\">Next<\\/span><\\/a><\\/div>\",\"css\":\"@media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {.imgBox {max-height: 80vh;height: 500px;width: 100%;overflow: hidden;position: relative;}.imgBox img {width: 100%;position: absolute;bottom: 0;left: 50%;transform: translateX(-50%);}.edw-limitedwidth-block .imgBox {max-height: unset;height: unset;overflow: unset;position: unset;}.edw-limitedwidth-block .imgBox img {position: unset;left: unset;transform: unset;}}.carousel-control-prev-icon, .carousel-control-next-icon {background-image: unset;}.carousel-indicators li {list-style-type: none;}@media screen and (min-width: 1200px) {.imgBox {max-height: 80vh;height: 600px;width: 100%;overflow: hidden;position: relative;}}@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {.carousel-caption p.font-size-80 {font-size: 14px !important }}\",\"js\":\"\"}', 2021071424, 0, 1, 'block', 'Sliders');
