stimonialdesign5\\/images\\/profile-images\\/profile-1.svg\\\" alt=\\\"profile-1\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-icon\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}testimonialdesign5\\/images\\/card-icon.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"profile-desc\\\"><span class=\\\"testimonial-user-name\\\">BERND KRAUSE<\\/span>,<label class=\\\"testimonial-user-desg\\\">Sumega GmbH<\\/label><\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc-box ellipsis\\\"><span class=\\\"card-desc edw-carousel-content-para\\\">Edwiser RemUI instantly elevates the look-and-feel of Moodle for everyone - teachers, admins and students alike. I like how the course format plugin functions on the front page. The course formats and the simple navigation help a great deal because my students have a good understanding of my offerings and the overall course structure. They are clear about what to do and where to go on the site, making learning easier. Edwiser RemUI beautifully handholds them through the process.<\\/span><span class=\\\"readMoreBtn\\\">read more<\\/span><span class=\\\"readLessBtn\\\">read less<\\/span><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"carousel-item edw-slider-item\\\" data-value=\\\"1\\\"><div class=\\\"item-container\\\"><div class=\\\"content-box\\\"><div class=\\\"profile-image-box\\\"><div><div><img class=\\\"edw-profile-img\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}testimonialdesign5\\/images\\/profile-images\\/profile-2.svg\\\" alt=\\\"profile-1\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-icon\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}testimonialdesign5\\/images\\/card-icon.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"profile-desc\\\"><span class=\\\"testimonial-user-name\\\">BERND KRAUSE<\\/span>,<label class=\\\"testimonial-user-desg\\\">Sumega GmbH<\\/label><\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc-box ellipsis\\\"><span class=\\\"card-desc edw-carousel-content-para\\\">Edwiser RemUI instantly elevates the look-and-feel of Moodle for everyone - teachers, admins and students alike. I like how the course format plugin functions on the front page. The course formats and the simple navigation help a great deal because my students have a good understanding of my offerings and the overall course structure. They are clear about what to do and where to go on the site, making learning easier. Edwiser RemUI beautifully handholds them through the process.<\\/span><span class=\\\"readMoreBtn\\\">read more<\\/span><span class=\\\"readLessBtn\\\">read less<\\/span><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"carousel-item edw-slider-item\\\" data-value=\\\"2\\\"><div class=\\\"item-container\\\"><div class=\\\"content-box\\\"><div class=\\\"profile-image-box\\\"><div><div><img class=\\\"edw-profile-img\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}testimonialdesign5\\/images\\/profile-images\\/profile-3.png\\\" alt=\\\"profile-1\\\"><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-icon\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}testimonialdesign5\\/images\\/card-icon.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"profile-desc\\\"><span class=\\\"testimonial-user-name\\\">BERND KRAUSE<\\/span>,<label class=\\\"testimonial-user-desg\\\">Sumega GmbH<\\/label><\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc-box ellipsis\\\"><span class=\\\"card-desc edw-carousel-content-para\\\">Edwiser RemUI instantly elevates the look-and-feel of Moodle for everyone - teachers, admins and students alike. I like how the course format plugin functions on the front page. The course formats and the simple navigation help a great deal because my students have a good understanding of my offerings and the overall course structure. They are clear about what to do and where to go on the site, making learning easier. Edwiser RemUI beautifully handholds them through the process.<\\/span><span class=\\\"readMoreBtn\\\">read more<\\/span><span class=\\\"readLessBtn\\\">read less<\\/span><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><button class=\\\"carousel-control-prev position-absolute edw-control-prev border-0 bg-transparent\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" data-target=\\\"#testimonia