(77, 'blogdesign1', 'Blog Design 1', '{{>cdnurl}}blogdesign1/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"section-blog-design-1\\\"><div class=\\\"section-container\\\"><h2  class=\\\"section-heading\\\">Latest Blog Posts<\\/h2><div class=\\\"card-container\\\"><div class=\\\"blog-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-img-box\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}blogdesign1\\/images\\/card-images\\/card-image-1.png\\\" alt=\\\"card-1\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-body\\\"><div class=\\\"tag-box\\\">Technology<\\/div><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">The Impact of Technology on the Workplace: How Technology is Changing<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-bottom\\\"><div class=\\\"profile-box\\\"><img class=\\\"footer-profile-img\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}blogdesign1\\/images\\/profile-images\\/profile-image-1.png\\\" alt=\\\"profile image1\\\"><p>Tracey Wilson<\\/p><\\/div><p class=\\\"date-lg\\\">August 20, 2022<\\/p><p class=\\\"date-sm\\\">Aug 20, 2022<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"blog-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-img-box\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}blogdesign1\\/images\\/card-images\\/card-image-2.png\\\" alt=\\\"card-1\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-body\\\"><div class=\\\"tag-box\\\">Design<\\/div><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Designers are connected with creative people and businesses on the lookout for great designs.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-bottom\\\"><div class=\\\"profile-box\\\"><img class=\\\"footer-profile-img\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}blogdesign1\\/images\\/profile-images\\/profile-image-2.png\\\" alt=\\\"profile image1\\\"><p>Jason Francisco<\\/p><\\/div><p class=\\\"date-lg\\\">August 27, 2022<\\/p><p class=\\\"date-sm\\\">Aug 27, 2022<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"blog-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-img-box\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}blogdesign1\\/images\\/card-images\\/card-image-3.png\\\" alt=\\\"card-1\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-body\\\"><div class=\\\"tag-box\\\">Sports<\\/div><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Goodison\'s roar drags Everton players over the 