(87, 'featuredesign1', 'Feature Design 1', '{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign1/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"section-feature-design-1\\\" ><div class=\\\"section-container\\\"><h2 class=\\\"section-heading\\\">Features<\\/h2><p class=\\\"section-desc\\\">The eLearning Features section provides a comprehensive range of tools and interactive online learning experience.<\\/p><div class=\\\"card-container\\\"><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-left\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign1\\/images\\/card-images\\/card-1.png\\\" alt=\\\"card-1\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-right\\\"><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Theme installation<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Choose from a theme recommended by our experts or provide us with your own preferred theme. We\'ll ensure a seamless professional implementation for a refreshed and optimized platform<\\/p><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"card-btn btn\\\">Learn More<\\/a><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-left\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign1\\/images\\/card-images\\/card-2.png\\\" alt=\\\"card-2\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-right\\\"><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Theme Activation<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">The process of activating a theme is really just the click of a button. However, deciding which theme you want to use, setting that theme up to look the way you want, and even changing to another theme<\\/p><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"card-btn btn\\\">Learn More<\\/a><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\",\"css\":\".section-feature-design-1 {padding: 50px 24px;}.section-feature-design-1 .section-container {max-width: 1320px;margin: 0 auto;}.section-feature-design-1 .section-container .card-container {max-width: 1096px;}.section-feature-design-1 .section-heading {color: #313848;text-align: center;margin: 0;}.section-feature-design-1 h2 {font-size: 34px;font-weight: 700;line-height: 42px;letter-spacing: -1px;}.section-feature-design-1 .section-de