(88, 'featuredesign2', 'Feature Design 2', '{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign2/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"section-feature-design-2\\\" ><div class=\\\"section-container\\\"><h2 class=\\\"section-heading\\\">Features<\\/h2><p class=\\\"section-desc\\\">The eLearning Features section provides a comprehensive range of tools and interactive online learning experience.<\\/p><div class=\\\"home-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-left\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign2\\/images\\/home-card-image.png\\\" alt=\\\"card-1\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-right\\\"><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">User control<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">If you think that open source software isn\\u2019t as powerful and user-friendly as commercial software consider this: WordPress powers over 70% of all websites. Why? because it\'s powerful, user-friendly AND free.<\\/p><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"card-btn btn\\\">Learn More<\\/a><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"card-container\\\"><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-img\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign2\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-1.svg\\\" alt=\\\"icon-1\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Resilient<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Skilled at finding creative solutions and making the most out of available resources<\\/p><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"card-btn btn\\\">Learn More<\\/a><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-img\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign2\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-2.svg\\\" alt=\\\"icon-1\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Versatile<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Capable of adapting and performing effectively in various roles or situations.<\\/p><a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"card-btn btn\\\">Learn More<\\/a><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-img\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign2\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-3.svg\\\" alt=\\\"icon-1\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Innovative<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\