(94, 'featuredesign8', 'Feature Design 8', '{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign8/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"section-feature-design-8\\\"><div class=\\\"section-container\\\"><h2 class=\\\"section-heading\\\">Millions of People Learning with Us<\\/h2><p class=\\\"section-desc\\\">After the successful series of the conferences, Cryptocurrency and Blockchain, we have decided to hold their 4th edition<\\/p><div class=\\\"card-container\\\"><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><p class=\\\"name\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-background-clip:text!important\\\">750+ Courses<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Align your business and training<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><p class=\\\"name\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-background-clip:text!important\\\">59 Awards in 2020<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Success recognized with 59 accolades.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><p class=\\\"name\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-background-clip:text!important\\\">300+ Certified Teachers<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Extensive certified teacher network.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><p class=\\\"name\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-background-clip:text!important\\\">1500+ Students<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Enthusiastic, ambitious, future-oriented.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\",\"css\":\".section-feature-design-8 {padding: 50px 24px;background-color: #FFF;}.section-feature-design-8 .section-container {max-width: 1320px;margin: 0 auto;}.section-feature-design-8 .section-container .section-desc {max-width: 500px;}.section-feature-design-8 .section-heading {color: #313848;text-align: center;margin: 0;}.section-feature-design-8 h2 {font-size: 40px;font-weight: 400;line-height: 50px;}.section-feature-design-8 .section-desc {color: #4c5a73;text-align: center;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 400;line-height: 22px;margin: 16px auto 0;}.section-feature-design-8 .card-container {margin-top: 40px;display: flex;flex-wrap: wrap;justify-content: space-between;gap: 24px;}.section-feature-design