(95, 'featuredesign9', 'Feature Design 9', '{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign9/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"section-feature-design-9\\\" ><div class=\\\"section-container wrapper\\\"><div class=\\\"left-section\\\"><div class=\\\"desc-box\\\"><h2  class=\\\"section-heading\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-background-clip: text !important\\\">600+<\\/h2><h2 class=\\\"left-desc\\\">Work Done in The Past<\\/h2><\\/div><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign9\\/images\\/home-image.png\\\" alt=\\\"home images\\\"><\\/div><div class=\\\"right-section\\\"><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-icon\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign9\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-1.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Consumer Goods<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Empowering Beauty counter sales consultants with the digital learning experiences to set them for success.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-icon\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign9\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-2.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Medical Equipment<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Reskilling BD\\u2019s clinical practitioners with engaging digital learning experiences while reducing training.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-icon\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign9\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-3.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Technology<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Jumpstarting Change Healthcare\\u2019s new brand after a series of mergers and acquisitions with compliance training.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><div class=\\\"card-icon\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign9\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-4.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><\\/div><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Restaurant<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Building confidence through competencies in Panera\\u2019s leadership during times of growth