(101, 'featuredesign15', 'Feature Design 15', '{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign15/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"section-feature-design-15\\\" ><div class=\\\"section-container wrapper\\\"><div class=\\\"left-section\\\"><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><img class=\\\"card-icon\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign15\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-1.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Proven track record<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Provides cutting-edge Moodle solutions for a transformative learning experience.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><img class=\\\"card-icon\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign15\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-2.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Global perspective<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Transforms online education globally, offering universal insights for Moodle solutions.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><img class=\\\"card-icon\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign15\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-3.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">End-to-end expertise<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Tailoring robust solutions for optimized Moodle setups and edu product development.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"><img class=\\\"card-icon\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesign15\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-4.svg\\\" alt=\\\"card icon\\\"><p class=\\\"card-heading\\\">Learning with Moodle<\\/p><p class=\\\"card-desc\\\">Comprehensive Moodle training & courses to empower educators and learners.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"right-section\\\"><div class=\\\"right-context\\\"><h2 class=\\\"section-heading\\\">Reasons to choose my expertise<\\/h2><p class=\\\"section-desc\\\">Choose my expertise for unparalleled insight, 25+ years of experience, and a commitment to reshaping digital learning. With a proven track record of successful e-learning transformations, I bring a wealth of knowledge Ensuring success in digital education.<\