(103, 'featuredesignhome', 'Feature Design Home', '{{>cdnurl}}featuredesignhome/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\" <section class=\\\"section-feature-design-10\\\" > <div class=\\\"section-container\\\"> <h2 class=\\\"section-heading\\\">Features<\\/h2> <p class=\\\"section-desc\\\">The eLearning Features section provides a comprehensive range of tools and interactive online learning experience.<\\/p><div class=\\\"card-container\\\"> <div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"> <div class=\\\"icon-box\\\"> <img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesignhome\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-1.svg\\\" alt=\\\"icon-1\\\"\\/> <\\/div><p class=\\\"name\\\">Resilient<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Able to withstand and recover quickly from difficult situations.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"> <div class=\\\"icon-box\\\"> <img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesignhome\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-2.svg\\\" alt=\\\"icon-2\\\"\\/> <\\/div><p class=\\\"name\\\">Versatile<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Capable of adapting & performing effectively in various roles.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"> <div class=\\\"icon-box\\\"> <img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesignhome\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-3.svg\\\" alt=\\\"icon-3\\\"\\/> <\\/div><p class=\\\"name\\\">Innovative<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Introducing new ideas, methods, or solutions to address challenges<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"> <div class=\\\"icon-box\\\"> <img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesignhome\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-4.svg\\\" alt=\\\"icon-4\\\"\\/> <\\/div><p class=\\\"name\\\">Empathetic<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Showing understanding and compassion towards the emotions<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"feature-card\\\"> <div class=\\\"icon-box\\\"> <img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}featuredesignhome\\/images\\/card-icons\\/icon-5.svg\\\" alt=\\\"icon-5\\\"\\/> <\\/div><p class=\\\"name\\\">Agile<\\/p><p class=\\\"desc\\\">Create fully tailored page layouts for your projects with possibilities.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\