(160, 'faqaccordion3', 'Accordion set 3', '{{>cdnurl}}faqaccordion3/thumbnail.png', '{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"section-heading\\\">Curious <strong style=\\\"color: #5CFF85;\\\">queries<\\/strong> corner <\\/h3><div class=\\\"edwiser-pb-faqaccordion3\\\" data-vvveb-disabled-area contenteditable=\\\"false\\\"><section class=\\\"section-accordion section-accordion1 edw-tab[[inst]]\\\" data-searchformshow=\\\"true\\\" data-noofquestionsshown=\\\"4\\\" data-paginationshow=\\\"true\\\"><div class=\\\"section-container wrapper\\\"><form class=\\\"search-form\\\"><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><input style=\\\"border-radius: 50px;\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" class=\\\"form-control\\\" name=\\\"searchquestion\\\" placeholder=\\\"Ask a question...\\\" value=\\\"\\\"><button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn-submitedit\\\"><img src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}faqaccordion3\\/images\\/icons\\/search.svg\\\" alt=\\\"search\\\"><\\/button><\\/div><\\/form><div class=\\\"accordion accordion-box\\\"><div class=\\\"faq-card edw-slider-item\\\"><div class=\\\"card-heading\\\" data-toggle=\\\"collapse\\\" data-target=\\\"#collapseOne\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"true\\\" aria-controls=\\\"collapseOne\\\"><span>What is a payment gateway?<\\/span><img class=\\\"expande-icon\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}faqaccordion3\\/images\\/icons\\/expande.svg\\\" alt=\\\"expand\\\"> <img class=\\\"collaps-icon\\\" src=\\\"{{>cdnurl}}faqaccordion3\\/images\\/icons\\/collaps.svg\\\" alt=\\\"collapse\\\"><\\/div><div id=\\\"collapseOne\\\" class=\\\"collapse show\\\"><div class=\\\"faq-card-body\\\"><p>A payment gateway is an ecommerce service that processes online payments for online as well as offline businesses. Payment gateways help accept payments by transferring key information from their merchant websites to issuing banks, card associations and online wallet players.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"faq-card edw-slider-item\\\"><div class=\\\"card-heading collapsed\\\" data-toggle=\\\"collapse\\\" data-target=\\\"#c