(10, 2, 2, 'Moodle updates are available (http://localhost/lms5)', 'Update notifications\r\n\r\nThere is a newer Moodle version available!\r\nMoodle 5.0.3+ (Build: 20251024) Version 2025041403.03 (Stable version)\r\nMoodle 5.1+ (Build: 20251024) Version 2025100600.03 (Stable version)\r\n\r\nSee http://localhost/lms5/admin/index.php for more details\r\n\r\nIt is strongly recommended that you update your site to the latest version to obtain all recent security and bug fixes.\r\n\r\nThere is a newer version for some of your plugins available!\r\nCustom certificate (mod_customcert) There is a new version 2025041400 available!\r\nVideo Time (mod_videotime) There is a new version 2025102500 available!\r\nLevel Up XP (block_xp) There is a new version 2025100500 available!\r\nEdwiser course formats (format_remuiformat) There is a new version 2025101400 available!\r\nMoodle Adminer (local_adminer) There is a new version 2025031700 available!\r\nMail (local_mail) There is a new version 2025050800 available!\r\nStatic Pages (local_staticpage) There is a new version 2025041401 available!\r\n\r\nSee http://localhost/lms5/admin/plugins.php for more details\r\n\r\nYour Moodle site http://localhost/lms5 is configured to automatically check for available updates. You are receiving this message as the administrator of the site. You can disable automatic checks for available updates in Site administration / Server / Update notifications or customise the delivery of this message via your preferences page.\r\n', 2, '<h1>Update notifications</h1>\r\n<h2>There is a newer Moodle version available!</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Moodle 5.0.3+ (Build: 20251024)</strong> Version 2025041403.03 (Stable version)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Moodle 5.1+ (Build: 20251024)</strong> Version 2025100600.03 (Stable version)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>See <a href=\"http://localhost/lms5/admin/index.php\">http://localhost/lms5/admin/index.php</a> for more details</p>\r\n<p>It is strongly recommended that you update your site to the latest version to obtain all recent security and bug fixes.</p>\r\n<h2>There is a newer version for some of your plugins available!</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Custom certificate</strong> (mod_customcert) There is a new version 2025041400 available!</li>\r\n<li><strong>Video Time</strong> (mod_videotime) There is a new version 2025102500 available!</li>\r\n<li><strong>Level Up XP</strong> (block_xp) There is a new version 2025100500 available!</li>\r\n<li><strong>Edwiser course formats</strong> (format_remuiformat) There is a new version 2025101400 available!</li>\r\n<li><strong>Moodle Adminer</strong> (local_adminer) There is a new version 2025031700 available!</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mail</strong> (local_mail) There is a new version 2025050800 available!</li>\r\n<li><strong>Static Pages</strong> (local_staticpage) There is a new version 2025041401 available!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>See <a href=\"http://localhost/lms5/admin/plugins.php\">http://localhost/lms5/admin/plugins.php</a> for more details</p>\r\n<footer><p style=\"font-size:smaller; color:#333;\">Your Moodle site <a href=\"http://localhost/lms5\">http://localhost/lms5</a> is configured to automatically check for available updates. You are receiving this message as the administrator of the site. You can disable automatic checks for available updates in Site administration / Server / Update notifications or customise the delivery of this message via your preferences page.</p></footer>', 'Update notifications', 'moodle', 'availableupdate', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1761723208, NULL),
(11, -10, 2, 'XP+ plugin disabled!', 'Level Up XP+ has been disabled!\n\nYou are receiving this notice as a warning because Level Up XP+ was\ndisabled to prevent potential issues. The two plugins Level Up XP\n(block_xp) and Level Up XP+ (local_xp) are currently incompatible with each\nother. This issue occurs when XP has been upgraded to a new major version\nwhile XP+ remains outdated.\n\nThis mismatch can lead to loss of functionality, bugs, and other unexpected\nconsequences. To resolve this, you must upgrade Level Up XP+.\n\n	* Level Up XP (block_xp) version: 18.3 (2025041303)\n	* Level Up XP+ (local_xp) version: 1.9.1 (Multi) (2020070300)\n	* Level Up XP+ expected version: 18\n\nAdditional resources:\n\n	* Upgrading documentation [1]\n	* XP+ deactivated documentation [2]\n	* Compatibility documentation [3]\n\n--\n\nThis notice was sent to all administrators. To disable all admin notices,\nplease visit Level Up XP\'s admin settings.\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] https://docs.levelup.plus/xp/docs/upgrade\n[2] https://docs.levelup.plus/xp/docs/addon-deactivated\n[3] https://docs.levelup.plus/xp/docs/requirements-compatibility\n', 2, '<p>Level Up XP+ has been disabled!</p>\n\n<p>You are receiving this notice as a warning because Level Up XP+ was disabled to prevent potential issues. The two plugins Level Up XP (block_xp) and Level Up XP+ (local_xp) are currently incompatible with each other. This issue occurs when XP has been upgraded to a new major version while XP+ remains outdated.</p>\n\n<p>This mismatch can lead to loss of functionality, bugs, and other unexpected consequences. To resolve this, you must upgrade Level Up XP+.</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Level Up XP (block_xp) version: 18.3 (2025041303)</li>\n<li>Level Up XP+ (local_xp) version: 1.9.1 (Multi) (2020070300)</li>\n<li>Level Up XP+ expected version: 18</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Additional resources:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.levelup.plus/xp/docs/upgrade\">Upgrading documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.levelup.plus/xp/docs/addon-deactivated\">XP+ deactivated documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.levelup.plus/xp/docs/requirements-compatibility\">Compatibility documentation</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>--</p>\n\n<p>This notice was sent to all administrators. To disable all admin notices, please visit Level Up XP\'s admin settings.</p>\n', NULL, 'block_xp', 'adminnotice', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1761734604, NULL),
(12, -10, 3, 'New sign in to your rap lms account', 'Hi omkar panchal,\n\nYour rap lms account was just signed in to from a new device.\n\n	* Your account: omkar panchalomkar2222@gmail.com\n	* Friday, 26 September 2025, 6:57 AM\n	* Device: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\n(KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/140.0.0.0\n	* IP: 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1\n\nIf this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.\n\nIf you don\'t recognise this activity, please change your password [1].\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] http://localhost/lms5/login/change_password.php\n', 1, '<p>Hi omkar panchal,</p>\n<p>Your rap lms account was just signed in to from a new device.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your account: omkar panchalomkar2222@gmail.com</li>\n<li>Friday, 26 September 2025, 6:57 AM</li>\n<li>Device:  Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/140.0.0.0</li>\n<li>IP: 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t recognise this activity, please <a href=\"http://localhost/lms5/login/change_password.php\">change your password</a>.</p>', 'Your omkar account was just signed in to from a new device.', 'moodle', 'newlogin', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1761734604, '{\"notificationiconurl\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/lms5\\/tokenpluginfile.php\\/3bf9594d03686a7cd0e41cc076a4cca3\\/31\\/user\\/icon\\/remui\\/f1?rev=1375\",\"courseid\":\"1\"}'),
(13, -10, 4, 'New sign in to your rap lms account', 'Hi User 1 test,\n\nYour rap lms account was just signed in to from a new device.\n\n	* Your account: test1 test1@gmail.com\n	* Monday, 13 October 2025, 1:52 PM\n	* Device: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\n(KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/141.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\n	* IP: 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1\n\nIf this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.\n\nIf you don\'t recognise this activity, please change your password [1].\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] http://localhost/lms5/login/change_password.php\n', 1, '<p>Hi User 1 test,</p>\n<p>Your rap lms account was just signed in to from a new device.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your account: test1 test1@gmail.com</li>\n<li>Monday, 13 October 2025, 1:52 PM</li>\n<li>Device:  Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/141.0.0.0 Safari/537.36</li>\n<li>IP: 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t recognise this activity, please <a href=\"http://localhost/lms5/login/change_password.php\">change your password</a>.</p>', 'Your test1 account was just signed in to from a new device.', 'moodle', 'newlogin', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1761734605, '{\"notificationiconurl\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/lms5\\/tokenpluginfile.php\\/314fdda25e8cbc7990b0bbd9b4dcd88a\\/71\\/user\\/icon\\/remui\\/f1?rev=1590\",\"courseid\":\"1\"}'),
(14, -10, 5, 'New sign in to your rap lms account', 'Hi User2 test,\n\nYour rap lms account was just signed in to from a new device.\n\n	* Your account: test2 test2@gmail.com\n	* Monday, 13 October 2025, 2:00 PM\n	* Device: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\n(KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/141.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/141.0.0.0\n	* IP: 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1\n\nIf this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.\n\nIf you don\'t recognise this activity, please change your password [1].\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] http://localhost/lms5/login/change_password.php\n', 1, '<p>Hi User2 test,</p>\n<p>Your rap lms account was just signed in to from a new device.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your account: test2 test2@gmail.com</li>\n<li>Monday, 13 October 2025, 2:00 PM</li>\n<li>Device:  Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/141.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/141.0.0.0</li>\n<li>IP: 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t recognise this activity, please <a href=\"http://localhost/lms5/login/change_password.php\">change your password</a>.</p>', 'Your test2 account was just signed in to from a new device.', 'moodle', 'newlogin', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1761734605, '{\"notificationiconurl\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/lms5\\/tokenpluginfile.php\\/31de9700e730d2eba02912ac996ad242\\/77\\/user\\/icon\\/remui\\/f1?rev=1599\",\"courseid\":\"1\"}');
