(10, 6, 'What\'s New in Edwiser RemUI', '5 New functional blocks for Edwiser Page builder\r\n\r\n1) Courses block: We have provided 3 layouts for Courses block\r\n\r\n2) Category block: 2 Layouts for category block\r\n\r\n3) Slider blocks: 5 Variation of Sliders that can be added to any page of your choice\r\n\r\n4) Forms Integration: You can now add/embed Edwiser Forms in your custom design\r\n\r\n5) Custom Modal: Create custom modal in Moodle and embed it in any Moodle page.\r\n\r\nNote: Edwiser Page builder allows you to add Edwiser RemUI specific custom moodle blocks on any Moodle page of your choice. Please update all the files in Edwiser RemUI package to get access to these new blocks in Edwiser Page builder.\r\n\r\nFind the documentation here: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://edwiser.org/documentation/edwiser-remui/edwiser-remui-page-builder-installation-and-setup/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Edwiser Page Builder</a>', 0, 2, '', 0, '{}');
